# infra/foundation — <% project.name %> (<% derived.env %>)

Generated by slipway from `templates/cloud/azure/files/infra/foundation`. Owns the registry, key vault, app identity, log analytics<%#eq options.compute "aca"%>, the Container Apps environment (`cae.tf`, shared by every `infra/apps/<app>`)<%/eq%> and the role assignments between them, inside `<% azure.resource_group %>` (created by `.slipway/setup-azure.sh`).

| Command | Who |
|---|---|
| `/slipway:plan <% derived.env %> --layer foundation` | anyone; read-only |
| `bash <plugin>/scripts/approve-apply.sh infra/foundation/tfplan.<% derived.env %>` | a human, in a separate terminal |
| `terraform -chdir=infra/foundation apply tfplan.<% derived.env %>` | the session, once, within 10 minutes of the approval |

State: `<% azure.state.storage_account %>/<% azure.state.container %>/<% project.name %>/foundation/<% derived.env %>.tfstate` (Entra ID auth). Provider needs `ARM_SUBSCRIPTION_ID` in the environment.
